# LFS tracking for large binary media assets intentionally kept in git.
#
# RULES:
# 1. *.zip and *.tar.* files are excluded from git entirely via .gitignore and
#    must NOT be added here. Adding an LFS rule for an ignored file is what
#    caused the "missing LFS object" issue that required a full history rewrite.
# 2. attached_assets/ is excluded from git entirely via .gitignore, so LFS
#    rules for files inside it are unnecessary and should not be added here.

artifacts/mockup-sandbox/public/intake-step1-tutorial.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
artifacts/small-claims-genie/public/intake-step1-tutorial.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
